WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.701
-Hello, everyone,

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.702
and welcome back to the attic.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.703
If you have been following

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.704
my three-months-plus journey

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.705
up here, you know we've had

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.706
to work out some kinks.

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:07.840
There have been book shenanigans

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.909
and infestation
of adorable wasps,

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:12.545
my hair part mysteriously
switching sides.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:16.416
And then, on top of all that,
some helpful eagle-eyed viewers

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.751
caught a bit of an irregularity
from our Monday show,

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.053
something that can
only be described

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.721
as an accidental cameo.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.522
I assure you we are looking
into this problem

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:25.592
and we will have it fixed.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.661
As I have repeatedly
told my many famous friends,

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:30.763
the door in my attic,
regardless

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.098
of its apparent
magical qualities,

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.634
is not to be abused
for walk-ons or plugs,

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.002
and I certainly don't
wanna be responsible

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.270
for anyone gettin'
trapped in there,

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:39.706
especially not Academy Award
nominee Ethan Hawke.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.007
Because, you know,
that man commits.

00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:44.777
If he gets trapped in there,
it's gonna be like 12 years,

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:45.978
"Boyhood"-style.

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:47.113
And, speaking of things
that feel like

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.347
they've gone on for 12 years,

00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:50.550
President Trump --
yes, the segues are back! --

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.886
and his allies on Fox News
have settled

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.720
on a strategy
for getting reelected.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.855
Economic reco--
Oh, sorry. I read that wrong.

00:00:56.855 --> 00:00:58.891
Racism!
Their strategy is racism.

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.827
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:04.697
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.432
Every day brings
fresh new evidence

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.835
of the depravity
and amoral criminality

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.003
of the Trump administration.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:11.804
The details may differ,
but, in many ways,

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:13.739
it feels like the same day
over and over again.

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:15.375
It's like we're all Bill Murray
in "Groundhog Day,"

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.742
except no one
is learning the piano

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.010
and we still hate Ned Ryerson.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.113
Get lost, Ned!

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.515
This is "Groundhog Day,"
if the ceremony was waiting

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:25.652
for the groundhog to make
his way down the ramp.

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:28.387
No matter what, it takes him
six more weeks of winter

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:29.589
to get from the top
to the bottom.

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.523
Congress could spend
the next decade

00:01:31.523 --> 00:01:33.425
investigating Trump and still
not get to everything.

00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:36.328
He's a racist tax cheat
who profits from his office,

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:38.731
wants to slow down testing
for a pandemic he ignored,

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.467
he's facing new accusations
that he extorted

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.469
multiple countries
to interfere in our elections

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.238
and, just today, we heard
damning congressional testimony

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:48.741
from a prosecutor
in the Roger Stone case,

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:50.877
alleging that top
Justice Department officials

00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.813
intervened to get favorable
treatment for Stone

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:55.981
because he was a political
ally of the president.

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:58.651
