inappropriate orders on cases

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.629 line:0%
in an effort to cater
to President Trump.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.865 line:0%
-Roger Stone was treated
differently because of politics.

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:15.001 line:0%
What I heard, repeatedly,

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.103 line:0%
was that this leniency
was happening

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.772 line:0%
because of Stone's
relationship to the president,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.976 line:0%
that the acting U.S. attorney
for the District of Columbia

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.676 line:0%
was receiving heavy pressure

00:02:24.676 --> 00:02:27.413 line:0%
