of the Department of Justice

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.847 line:0%
and that his instructions to us

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:31.684 line:0%
were based on political
considerations.

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:34.153 line:0%
And I was told
that the acting U.S. attorney

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:36.155 line:0%
was giving Stone a break
because he was afraid

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:38.124 line:0%
of the president
of the United States.

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:39.492
-Of course they're afraid
of the president.

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.160
Look at him.
Looks like something

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.563
