Finish your maths, Liam,

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:47.700
or the fire gollum
will climb into the window

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.701
and eat your hands.

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.670
He'll eat your hands, Liam!

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.171
Looks like something
that would pop out at you

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.473
on a Amazon River cruise.

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:55.775
Anaconman.

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:56.909
Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.877
That one deserves
an attic high-five.

00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:01.047
-[ Electronic voice ]

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:03.949
-[ Clap ]

00:03:03.949 --> 00:03:05.384
The president subverted
the rule of law

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:07.353
